{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12341","headline":"药堂秋暮 · 钱起","name":"药堂秋暮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐来未得道，岁去媿云松。\n茅屋空山暮，荷衣白露浓。\n唯怜石苔色，不染世人踪。\n潭静宜孤鹤，山深绝远钟。\n有时丹竈上，数点彩霞重。\n勉事壶公术，仙期待赤龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}